+                    "Yes. Stay. I sleep badly. Nightmares. Very funny ones. Not with you here.")
+                : one(seed, "It's daytime! Scandalous! ...Tonight.", "Not tonight, the ringmaster is exhausted. ...Stay close anyway."), 0,
